cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "GROMACS MD Pipeline for Protein-Ligand Complexes"
abstract: >
  An automated Bash pipeline for molecular dynamics simulations of protein-ligand
  complexes using GROMACS. Includes GPU support, MM-PBSA binding free energy
  calculations, advanced analysis (PCA, DCCM, contact maps), interactive HTML
  reports, and HPC-ready SLURM/SGE templates. Applied in the undergraduate thesis
  "Caracterización termodinámica in silico de tetralonas como inhibidores de
  BCL-2, Caspasa-9 y p53 mediante dinámica molecular, MM-PBSA y cálculos
  alquímicos de energía libre (RBFE/ABFE) en GROMACS" (ESPOL, 2026) to
  simulate tetralonic compound complexes with BCL-2, Caspase-9, and p53,
  and compute MM-PBSA binding free energies.
authors:
  - family-names: "Rosero"
    given-names: "Bryan"
    affiliation: "Escuela Superior Politécnica del Litoral (ESPOL), Ecuador"
